<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About Admizz Education</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Admizz Education</strong> is a leading education consultancy helping students navigate university admissions. They handle thousands of student inquiries annually about programs, eligibility, application processes, and deadlines. Their team of counselors provides personalized guidance for students seeking to study abroad.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The challenge</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    With growing student interest in international education, Admizz was overwhelmed with inquiries. Students asked similar questions repeatedly&mdash;about application deadlines, document requirements, and program eligibility. Counselors spent most of their time answering routine questions instead of providing high-value personalized guidance.
  </p>
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6">
    <p class="mb-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Key pain points:</p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">
      <li>&bull; Average response time of 24+ hours for initial inquiries</li>
      <li>&bull; 70% of questions were repetitive FAQs</li>
      <li>&bull; Counselors burned out from repetitive work</li>
      <li>&bull; Students frustrated with slow responses during application seasons</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The solution</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Admizz implemented Zunkiree Search to power an AI-native inquiry system. Students can now ask questions in natural language and receive instant, accurate answers. The system understands context&mdash;it knows that "IELTS requirement for UK universities" is different from "IELTS requirement for Australian universities."
  </p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Natural language understanding</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Students ask questions naturally: "What documents do I need for a US student visa?" and get direct answers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Contextual responses</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">The system understands context and provides answers specific to the student's situation and target country.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Seamless escalation</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Complex queries are automatically routed to human counselors with full context preserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

